## Commit integration (Cursor)

When user asks to commit:

1. Stage code changes.
2. Refresh `docs/hda.md` as above.
3. Run `./tools/sync-hda-site.sh` (and `--check`).
4. Run `./tools/check-site-chrome.sh` if `site/` changed.
5. Stage `docs/hda.md` + `site/hda.json` (+ `site/hda.html` if copy changed; never drop chrome files).
6. Commit once (preferred) or code commit + immediate `docs(hda):` commit.
7. In the PR/summary, one line: `HDA: months_to_everest X→Y · overall A%→B% · ETA YYYY-MM`.

CI enforces freshness: `./tools/sync-hda-site.sh --check` must pass. CI also runs `./tools/check-site-chrome.sh`.

